s/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:3px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Varbergs_BoIS_FC\" title=\"Varbergs BoIS FC\">Varberg</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:21.5%; left:64.9%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4ster%C3%A5s_SK_FK\" title=\"Västerås SK FK\">Västerås</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:54.8%; left:16.7%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:69.1%; left:46.2%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%\">Geografisk placering av de deltagande lagen i Superettan 2019.</div>\n</div>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Lag_och_arenor\">Lag och arenor</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2019&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Lag och arenor\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2019&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Lag och arenor\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>16 lag kvalificerade sig för spel i Superettan 2019 efter resultat från <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2018\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2018\">Allsvenskan 2018</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2018\" title=\"Superettan 2018\">Superettan 2018</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/Division_1_i_fotboll_f%C3%B6r_herrar_2018\" title=\"Division 1 i fotboll för herrar 2018\">Division 1 2018</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Nya lag från Allsvenskan var Dalkurd FF och Trelleborgs FF som direktkvalificerades, samt IF Brommapojkarna som förlorade i kvalspelet till Allsvenskan mot <a href=\"/wiki/AFC_Eskilstuna\" title=\"AFC Eskilstuna\">AFC Eskilstuna</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> på färre gjorda mål på bortaplan. Från Division 1 kom de två seriesegrarna i Division 1 Norra (Västerås SK) respektive Södra (Mjällby AIF), samt Syrianska FC som vann kvalspelet till Superettan mot <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_V%C3%A4rnamo\" title=\"IFK Värnamo\">IFK Värnamo</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> \n</p><p>Varberg BoIS lyckades vinna sitt kvalspel mot <a href=\"/wiki/Oskarshamns_AIK\" title=\"Oskarshamns AIK\">Oskarshamns AIK</a> och stannade därmed kvar från Superettan 2018.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Övriga lag kvalificerade sig genom att ha placerat sig på fjärde till tolfte plats i föregående års serie.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"130\">Lag\n</th>\n<th width=\"140\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sveriges_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Sveriges län\">Län</a>\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Ort\n</th>\n<th>Arena\n</th>\n<th>Underlag\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Kapacitet\n</th>\n<th>Placering<br />2018\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Dalkurd_FF\" title=\"Dalkurd FF\">Dalkurd FF</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Gävleborgs län\"><img alt=\"Gävleborgs län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/20px-G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/40px-G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/G%C3%A4vleborgs_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Gävleborgs län\">Gävleborg</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/G%C3%A4vle\" title=\"Gävle\">Gävle</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gavlevallen\" title=\"Gavlevallen\">Gavlevallen</a>\n</td>\n<td>Konstgräs\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;06432.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>6&#160;432\n</td>\n<td><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-14\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\" class=\"sortkey\">b &#xfeff;</span><span class=\"sorttext\">15</span> <small>(<a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2018\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2018\">AS</a>)</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors_IF\" title=\"Degerfors IF\">Degerfors IF</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Örebro län\"><img alt=\"Örebro län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/20px-%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg/40px-%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n_vapen.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"251\" data-file-height=\"304\" /></a></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Örebro län\">Örebro</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors\" title=\"Degerfors\">Degerfors</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stora_Valla\" title=\"Stora Valla\">Stora Valla</a>\n</td>\n<td>Gräs\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;07500.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>7&#160;500\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-15\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span style=\"display:none\" class=\"sortkey\">g &#xfeff;</span><span class=\"sorttext\">7</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gais\" title=\"Gais\">Gais</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4stra_G%C3%B6talands_l%C3%A4n\" title=\"Västra Götalands län\"><img alt=\"Västra Götalands län\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/V%C3%A4stra_G%C3%B6taland_vapen.svg/20px-V%C3%A4stra_G%C3%B6taland_vapen.