or\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-streaks2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-streaks2_1-0\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r58662249\">@media screen,handheld,projection{.mw-parser-output cite .printonly{display:none}}</style><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"web\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.soccerstats.com/table.asp?league=sweden2&amp;tid=g\">”Superettan streaks and sequences”</a>. soccerstats.com<span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.soccerstats.com/table.asp?league=sweden2&amp;tid=g\">http://www.soccerstats.com/table.asp?league=sweden2&amp;tid=g</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 3 november 2019</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.btitle=Superettan+streaks+and+sequences&amp;rft.atitle=&amp;rft.pub=soccerstats.com&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.soccerstats.com%2Ftable.asp%3Fleague%3Dsweden2%26tid%3Dg&amp;rfr&#95;id=info:sid/en.wikipedia.org:Superettan&#95;2019\"><span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r58662249\" /><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"web\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20230208135620/https://www2.svenskfotboll.se/superettan/information/?scr=spectators&amp;ftid=77487\">”Publikliga - Superettan”</a>. svenskfotboll.se. Arkiverad från <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www2.svenskfotboll.se/superettan/information/?scr=spectators&amp;ftid=77487\"